The error message indicates that the column "selected_cars.Cylinders" does not exist. This is because the "Cylinders" column is not included in the subquery "selected_cars". To fix this, we need to include the "Cylinders" column in the subquery.

Here is the corrected SQL:

```sql
SELECT Id, Make 
FROM (
    SELECT cars_data.Id, car_names.Make, cars_data.Cylinders 
    FROM cars_data 
    JOIN car_names ON cars_data.Id = car_names.MakeId 
    WHERE cars_data.Horsepower > (SELECT MIN(Horsepower) FROM cars_data)
) AS selected_cars 
WHERE selected_cars.Cylinders <= 3
```

